<%- include("partials/header",{title:"Support Center"}) %>
<main class="lightPage"><div class="lightTitle"><div class="wrap"><h1>Support Center</h1><p>Answers to common questions and ways to reach the team.</p></div></div><div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px">
<div class="paperCard" style="margin-bottom:14px">
  <h3>Installation trouble?</h3>
  <p class="muted">Download the launcher from the <a href="/downloads" style="color:#2f9b43;font-weight:800">Downloads</a> page and extract it into an empty folder. Most install or launch issues are solved with <strong>Install / Repair Files</strong>. Always start EverLeaf through the launcher rather than opening the game EXE directly.</p>
</div>
<div class="paperCard" style="margin-bottom:14px">
  <h3>Can't log in?</h3>
  <p class="muted">Your EverLeaf website account is also your game account. If you can still sign in to the website, use the <a href="/account" style="color:#2f9b43;font-weight:800">Account</a> page to change your password.</p>
</div>
<div class="paperCard" style="margin-bottom:14px">
  <h3>Find ID / Find Password</h3>
  <p class="muted">Automatic public account recovery is not enabled yet. If you forgot your username or cannot sign in to change your password, contact EverLeaf staff through Discord. Never post your password publicly; staff should only need account-identifying information to verify ownership.</p>
</div>
<div class="paperCard">
  <h3>Still need help?</h3>
  <p class="muted">Join the community Discord for the fastest response from staff and other players.</p>
  <% if(brand.discordUrl){ %><a class="btn primary" href="<%=brand.discordUrl%>">JOIN DISCORD</a><% } else { %><a class="btn primary" href="/community">VISIT COMMUNITY</a><% } %>
</div>
</div></main><%- include("partials/footer") %>
